flowchart LR
  Request[Customer request] --> Discuss[Human discussion]
  Discuss --> Contract[Bounded work contract]
  Contract --> Run[Local or cloud run]
  Run --> Evidence[Versioned review package]
  Evidence --> Review[Second human review]
  Review -->|Changes needed| Contract
  Review -->|Criteria satisfied| Accept[Explicit acceptance]
  Accept --> Publish[Separately authorized external action]
